  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cash Transfer for Orphans and Vulnerable Children Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Development Objective is to increase social safety net access for  at least 35,000 extremely poor OVC households in at least 14  districts, through an effective and efficient expansion of the CT-OVC  Program, through:(i) support to increase capacity of the DCS to manage  the CT-OVC program; and (ii) support to effective program  implementation in selected districts, by providing timely and  predictable transfers to eligible OVC households, and by contributing  to improved human capital for OVC in those households.</narrative>
  </description>
